&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Director, Outcomes, Value &amp;amp; Access will serve as Kymera’s strategic leader for health economics, real-world evidence (RWE), value communication, and payer-relevant medical strategy across the pipeline. Reporting to the VP of Medical Affairs, this role will shape and execute the company’s integrated outcomes and access strategy to support optimized patient access, informed clinical decision-making, and successful product commercialization. The ideal candidate is an experienced HEOR leader with deep immunology expertise (dermatology and/or respiratory strongly preferred), a proven track record preparing for and supporting launches, and significant experience engaging national and regional payer stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic and forward-thinking, with the ability to translate scientific evidence into compelling value narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative, diplomatic, and influential across functions and levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator with exceptional scientific and business acumen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in a dynamic, rapidly growing biotech setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and execution of Kymera’s Medical Outcomes, Value &amp;amp; Access strategy across the immunology portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a core member of the Medical Affairs Team, advising on evidence generation, clinical strategy, and payer-relevant insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment on value strategy across Medical Affairs, HEOR, Market Access, Clinical Development, Regulatory, Commercial, and Global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health Economics &amp;amp; Outcomes Research (HEOR)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee HEOR strategy, including economic modeling, treatment-pattern studies, and comparative-effectiveness analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide development and validation of economic models (e.g., budget impact, cost-effectiveness) to support payer decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead creation of AMCP dossiers, value narratives, and scientific payer resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-World Evidence &amp;amp; Data Generation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and oversee RWE plans, including study concept refinement, protocol development, external data partnerships, and post-marketing evidence strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Clinical Development and Data Science teams to integrate outcomes-focused endpoints into clinical trial design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payer &amp;amp; External Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
