&lt;li&gt;Lead scientific exchange with medical directors, formulary decision-makers, and population-health leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct advisory boards on HEOR, RWE, and access-related topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
