&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership for value and access–related launch preparation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Market Access to ensure scientific accuracy and strategic alignment of access resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as lead on health technology assessment (HTA) readiness for future ex-US markets, in partnership with global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support field medical teams with training on HEOR, RWE, and payer communication.&lt;/li&gt;
