&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PhD in Biochemistry, Biology, Chemistry, or Chemical Biology with a minimum of 2 years of experience in targeted, mass spectrometry–based proteomics in an industry or startup biotech setting; &lt;strong&gt;or&lt;/strong&gt; BS/MS with 8+ years of relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
