&lt;li&gt;Development and deployment of highly multiplexed and sensitive PRM or MRM stable isotope–labeled peptide assays using DDA and DIA data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development of immunoaffinity enrichment methods to enhance MS assay sensitivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of techniques for optimizing protein recovery from complex biological matrices (cells, tissues, biofluids) derived from human and preclinical species.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operation, maintenance, and troubleshooting of nanoLC and Orbitrap MS instrumentation.&lt;/li&gt;
